01:31:46.708 --> 01:31:48.167
We're doctors.

824
01:31:53.583 --> 01:31:54.375
Don't shoot.

825
01:31:54.406 --> 01:31:56.772
Don't shoot. Don't...

826
01:31:57.206 --> 01:31:59.706
Get down!
