I came here to help you.

884
01:40:13.673 --> 01:40:14.840
Come here.

885
01:40:19.174 --> 01:40:20.840
Oh, shit!

886
01:40:22.417 --> 01:40:24.750
You need… You need…

887
01:40:24.833 --> 01:40:28.167
