913
01:45:47.750 --> 01:45:49.083
A bad dream.

914
01:45:52.583 --> 01:45:53.708
Poor thing.

915
01:45:56.333 --> 01:45:57.542
Don't worry.

916
01:45:58.750 --> 01:46:04.083
