917
01:46:04.417 --> 01:46:06.333
go away.

918
01:46:16.417 --> 01:46:17.833
Calm down.

919
01:46:19.167 --> 01:46:20.292
Calm down.

920
01:46:55.875 --> 01:46:57.333
